WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:35.860
I caused trouble for everyone in the volleyball club.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:44.910
Well, would you like me to train with you?

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.080
Train with you?

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:54.090
Come on. Let's start before the sun sets.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.180
Okay, let's do it!

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.310
Are you ready, Kasuga-san?

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:03.850
Yes.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:05.730
Here!

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:19.700
I did it!

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:38.220
I feel great!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.940
Kasuga-san, do you want to keep going?

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.930
Will you go to the beach with me?

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:38.980
An Exciting Sea

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.290
Bus Stop

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.290
Seaside

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.010
Kasuga-san! Hurry, hurry!

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.470
Hold on, Riku-kun!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.520
It's the sea!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.190
Well, we can see it from school anytime.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.820
But, it's been so long since I've been to the beach!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:28.160
I've never gone to the beach with my friends before.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:29.950
It's the sea!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.790
It's so vast! It's so blue! It's so huge!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.880
Oh, Riku-kun!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.880
I feel great!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.560
I'll be all alone with Riku-kun today.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.190
Tokimeki

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.190
Beach

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.190
House

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.190
Yakisoba

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.410
Do I look weird in this?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.870
No! It's perfect!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.080
I'm cute!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.210
Riku-kun!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.630
Thanks for waiting!

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:25.470
Kasuga-san!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.730
Um... How do I look in this swimsuit?

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.020
Well... You look cute!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.150
Thanks.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.700
Um... Riku-kun.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.620
We shouldn't just stand here all day.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.120
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.280
Well then...

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.170
Okay.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:08.680
We've got another 99 million, 999 thousand, 999 laps to go!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.510
Don't fall behind!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.350
Our training has just begun!

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.440
What was that?

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:29.700
Take that!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.740
Here I go!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:34.580
Take that!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.750
You're terrible, Riku-kun!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.210
You started it!

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:41.580
To hell with you!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.540
Kasuga-san?

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:47.050
Kasuga-san, are you angry?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.220
Now you've really done it!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.180
Did I surprise you?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.470
Hold it!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.100
Wait up!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.610
I really am...

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.540
I can't go on.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.250
Tired already, Riku-kun?

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.290
Say, why don't we take a break?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.210
Good idea.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.380
I'm thirsty too.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:31.720
Okay, I'll get us something to drink, so just wait here.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:32.380
Okay!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.390
Tokimeki

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.390
Beach

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.390
House

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.390
Yakisoba

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.310
Excuse me!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.560
Two juices, please!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.730
Right away! Juice, right?

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.320
Onee-san!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.110
What are you doing here?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.610
We can earn lots of money during summer.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.660
We have to work while other people relax.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.820
Here you go! Thanks for waiting.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.080
Huh?

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:08.840
What's wrong, Ayame?

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.090
Was that...

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.850
Riku-kun's taking a long time.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.600
I thought it was you, Tsukasa!

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:21.770
Ayame!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.310
Wh-Why are you here?

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:26.190
Didn't I tell you?

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.770
The beach volleyball tournament is today.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.570
Huh? It's today?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.360
Never mind that, Tsukasa.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.950
Did you come here with Aoba-kun?

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.030
Yes, that's right.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.410
So that really was...

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.040
Did something happen to Riku-kun?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.290
Let me out!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.670
Let me out!

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.340
Let me out!

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.670
Let me outta here!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.380
You're looking good, Aoba.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.970
How about that? Insulting, isn't it?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.720
Why are you doing this to me?

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.970
What do you mean? You don't understand how others feel!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:04.730
That's right! You came to the beach, but you didn't tell us anything about it!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:05.890
That's right!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.020
Let's make this bigger!

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:09.730
Stop it!

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.480
It's heavy!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.440
Aoba!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:19.780
How dare you go on a date with anyone except Amamiya!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.490
D-Doujima-kun!

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:27.540
Did you forget our manly promise to protect Amamiya-san?

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.460
But we didn't make a promise!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.960
Then I'll make you remember it!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.420
With my fist!

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.550
Stop it!

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.180
It's all a misunderstanding!

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.970
It's not a misunderstanding!

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.270
Our Tower of Anger!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.690
Riku-kun? Tower of Anger?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:47.850
What's going on?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.810
Shut up, Aoba!

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.860
This is the pain my heart feels!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.530
Don't bother arguing!

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.610
Feel what I feel!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.110
Riku-kun!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.210
Aoba...

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.580
Doujima-kun!

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.210
Ah, that was impossible to evade.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:11.790
What happened?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.260
Oh, you're training with us, too?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.180
We're...

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.430
This isn't what we wanted to do!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:24.260
We've got 99 million, 576 thousand, 254 laps to go!

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:27.950
That was dangerous, Riku-kun.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.690
Hiyoko-kun! What are you doing here?

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:35.860
Every once and a while, even I, want to see the sea.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.530
I see.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:49.750
This sucks! At this rate, I won't get to be alone with Riku-kun!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.330
Kasuga-san? Where are we going?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.040
Never mind that. Just follow me!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:54.800
Okay!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.090
Look, Riku-kun. That area there is completely deserted!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.880
All right! We found a good spot!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:00.430
Let's go!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:04.970
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.310
It's still not enough!

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:09.520
My muscles. My magnificence!

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.190
And my beauty!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:14.610
I get more and more magnificent!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.980
Take me to the field of God!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:21.360
Use your energy and you will achieve true beauty!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.130
I've sweat so much!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.420
We'll find it this time!

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.180
Drinking beer in the afternoon feels great!

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:45.100
You're drinking too much, Hoshino-sensei.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.850
Who cares? It's just for one day!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.390
That's right. Don't be such a wet blanket.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.730
You drink one too!

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.900
Okay. I'll have one.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.320
Once again, cheers!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.650
Cheers!

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:02.450
Let's go up on the rocks.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.660
O-Okay.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:13.620
An unusual species of crab. It probably won't be a good research sample.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.750
I'll go to the deep sea!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.420
Wait for me, creatures of the sea!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:24.180
I, Wagen Yuuichi, will research your life cycles!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.770
Wh-What about that rock over there?

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.730
You're scaring me, Kasuga-san.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.150
Just follow me!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.070
Okay.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.570
You're annoying. Go somewhere else.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.870
Why did it end up like this?!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.250
Why is everyone here?!

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:54.650
I sympathize with you.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.920
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.770
Are you all right, Senpai?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.110
I-I-I-I'm fine!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:27.570
Utsumi-senpai, you shouldn't be working as a lifeguard.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.120
H-Hey, Kasuga-san.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.420
Are you hungry?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.170
Why don't we have lunch?

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.550
Y-Yeah.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.840
We've got 62 million, 238 thousand, and 36 laps to go!

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:51.930
Kasuga-san.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.100
Here we go, Ayame!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:13:59.520
All right!

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.280
Shiina-san's amazing!

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.420
Over here, Kasuga-san!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.380
What happened all of a sudden?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.420
Never mind that. Just come with me.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.650
I found this earlier.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.860
No one else is here, so we can take our time and play around.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.820
Yeah. Yeah!

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.200
Oh, Aoba-kun.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.450
Kasuga-san.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.280
Amamiya-san!

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.200
Why are you here?

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.160
One of my relatives runs a lodge here.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:03.420
But it's being renovated now, so I came here to help them out.

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:09.970
You must be working hard!

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:14.970
Actually, this is a private beach for guests only, so...

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:18.390
You can play here if you like.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:20.810
Really?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.860
Yes. Just stay away from the buildings.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:26.860
Did you hear that? This is great, Kasuga-san!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.150
B-But...

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:33.620
Amamiya-san says it's okay, so let's be happy and play!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.200
Okay?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.660
O-Okay.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.470
Here I go, Riku-kun!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.280
Kasuga-san!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.610
What are you doing?

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.160
It's your fault for not paying attention.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.870
I guess I've got no choice.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:19.540
Hmph!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.670
Oh, Riku-kun!

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.340
He's been thinking about Amamiya-san all this time!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.760
Sorry. The ball...

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:36.930
Oh yeah!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.010
In that case...

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.270
Everyone's over there.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.520
I see.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.190
Riku-kun! Help me!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.520
Kasuga-san!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.520
My foot!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.400
Help me!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.940
Riku-kun!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.280
Kasuga-san! Hold on to me!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.440
Riku-kun!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.570
It's all right now. Calm down.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:56.110
Okay.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.330
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.290
Thank you, Riku-kun.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.960
Aoba!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.790
Come join your friends!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:10.750
Riku-kun?

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.380
It's a complete success!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.590
Did we surprise you?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.510
Riku-kun!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.300
Riku-kun!

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:21.850
Yayoi-san!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:22.600
Yes?

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.440
Hang in there, Riku-kun!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.690
Riku-kun!

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.030
We're sorry, Riku-kun.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.940
It's all because we were fooling around.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.530
Never mind that. What's his condition?

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.200
Is he all right?

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.240
It looks like he swallowed quite a bit of water.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:41.080
Is he breathing?

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.160
Yes. But it's very faint.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.040
I've got no choice.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.460
I'll perform CPR.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.540
The kiss of life.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.010
Utsumi-san!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.720
Oh no!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.640
What happened to Aoba?

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.650
We don't know how to perform CPR.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.480
I-I...

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:13.820
I'll do it.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.700
I haven't tried it before, though.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.580
Th-Th-Th-The kiss of life?

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.700
If it's Aoba-san, then...

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.180
Captain!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.390
Leave it to me!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:41.890
Secret Technique

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.310
Blue Lightning Strike

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.310
Ao Raigeki Otoshi

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.280
He came back to life!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.990
What a relief, Aoba!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.110
Aoba-san!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.150
I'm so sorry!

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.820
I hit you by accident!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.870
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.240
Wh-What happened to me?

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.080
Are you okay, Aoba-kun?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.710
What do you mean?

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.130
That's good. Aoba-kun woke up.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.250
Oh yeah.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:14.710
Where's Kasuga-san?

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:15.800
Come to think of it...

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.420
I haven't seen her for a while.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.650
Geez, I'm so stupid!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.610
It's all because I pretended to drown.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:41.700
I caused so much trouble for everyone. If only I hadn't done that...

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.210
So that's where you were.

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.340
R-Riku-kun?

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.590
Kasuga-san!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.010
H-Hey!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:01.420
I'm so glad.

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.720
If you're so energetic, then you're okay.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.060
I was worried about you.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:09.180
You suddenly vanished after you drowned.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:19.480
Riku-kun! I'm... I'm so sorry!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.860
It's all my fault!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.700
I'm so sorry!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.280
What's wrong, Kasuga-san?

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:24.820
Kasuga-san?

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.080
Kasuga-san!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.710
No way. I never thought that
you were pretending to drown.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:36.080
Geez.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:38.130
That doesn't matter.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.210
I apologized for that earlier.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.800
I don't mind, but...

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.930
You put on a really good act!

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:46.010
You could join the drama club!

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.220
Y-You think so?

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:50.970
I guess I found a new talent.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:54.640
Anyway, it's deserted now.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:55.900
Yeah.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.900
This is fine for me.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.740
But we can't swim now.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.900
Geez. You still don't get it?

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:06.030
What do you mean?

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.250
I can't say that, either.

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.790
I'm so depressed.

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.750
Okay, I'll tell you.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:19.500
Okay.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:24.010
Well, I... With you...

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:24.630
With me?

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.390
I wanted to be with you.

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.050
With me?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.400
K-Kasuga-san?

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:44.900
So... With me...

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.780
Oh, Aoba-kun!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:51.030
I respect your spirit for joining our special training!

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.200
No, I...

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.830
Now we only have 309 thousand and 856 laps left!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.420
Get fired up and follow me!

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.340
Why me?!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:04.960
You know what, Riku-kun?

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:09.510
You really are destined to be my man.

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:37.160
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.210
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.180
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:30.220
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.890
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.410
Next Episode Preview

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:51.570
Yayoi-kun!

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:52.700
Are you worried about something?

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:54.700
Well, a little...

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:55.780
I see!

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:57.990
Then let's shout out into the sunset!

00:23:57.990 --> 00:23:59.120
Shout out your feelings!

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:01.040
But... Um... Well...

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.210
What's wrong?

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:03.630
Why are you hesitating?

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.170
Because it's about the boy I like...

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:07.300
So I'm embarrassed...

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:11.050
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:11.050 --> 00:24:12.300
An Exciting Evening.

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:13.220
Please watch it.

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:15.390
Damn it!

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:17.010
My sweetheart is...

00:24:17.430 --> 00:24:19.970
A white ball!
